SRME = CUSTOM0;
AAWE = CUSTOM1;
EEEE = CUSTOM2;

This will stop project from crashing:
SRME = vec4(1.0);//CUSTOM0;
AAWE = vec4(1.0);//CUSTOM1;
EEEE = vec4(1.0);//CUSTOM2;

Weirdly but if i dont touch assigning varyings and comment this "UV = CUSTOM3.xy * uv_normal_scale.xy;" everything works 

// IF COMMENTED -> GAME UNFREEZES
UV = UV * uv1_scale.xy + (uv1_offset.xy);
